msgid "Installed products updated."
msgstr "Instalētie produkti atjaunināti."

#: src/plugins/dnf/subscription_manager.py:45
#, python-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"*** WARNING ***\n"
"The subscription for following product(s) has expired:\n"
"%s\n"
"You no longer have access to the repositories that provide these products.  "
"It is important that you apply an active subscription in order to resume "
"access to security and other critical updates. If you don't have other "
"active subscriptions, you can renew the expired subscription.  "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"*** BRĪDINĀJUMS ***\n"
"Šāda(-u) produkta(-u) abonementa derīgums ir beidzies:\n"
"%s\n"
"Jums vairs nav piekļuves repozitorijiem, kas nodrošina šos produktus.  Lai "
"atjaunotu piekļuvi drošības un citiem kritiskiem atjauninājumiem, ir svarīgi "
"lietot aktīvu abonementu. Ja jums nav citu aktīvu abonementu, varat atjaunot "
"beigušos abonementu.  "

#: src/plugins/dnf/subscription_manager.py:54
msgid ""
"\n"
"This system is not registered with an entitlement server. You can use "
"subscription-manager to register.\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Šī sistēma nav reģistrēta piešķīrumu serverī. Reģistrēšanai varat izmantot "
"subscription-manager.\n"

#: src/plugins/dnf/subscription_manager.py:58
msgid ""
"\n"
"This system is not registered with an entitlement server. You can use "
"\"rhc\" or \"subscription-manager\" to register.\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Šī sistēma nav reģistrēta piešķīrumu serverī. Reģistrēšanai varat izmantot "
"\"rhc\" vai \"subscription-manager\".\n"

#: src/plugins/dnf/subscription_manager.py:63
msgid ""
"\n"
"This system is registered with an entitlement server, but is not receiving "
"updates. You can use subscription-manager to assign subscriptions.\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Šī sistēma ir reģistrēta piešķīrumu serverī, bet nesaņem atjauninājumus. "
"Abonementu piešķiršanai varat izmantot subscription-manager.\n"

#: src/plugins/dnf/subscription_manager.py:68
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"This system has release set to {release_version} and it receives updates "
"only for this release.\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Šai sistēmai iestatīts laidiens {release_version}, un tā saņem "
"atjauninājumus tikai šim laidienam.\n"

#: src/plugins/dnf/subscription_manager.py:72
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"The system clock is skewed. There is a time difference of {time_drift} "
"seconds with the entitlement server. Please check your clock settings to "
"ensure access to all entitled content.\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Sistēmas pulkstenis ir nobīdījies. Laika atšķirība ar piešķīrumu serveri ir "
"{time_drift} sekundes. Lūdzu, pārbaudiet pulksteņa iestatījumus, lai "
"nodrošinātu piekļuvi visam piešķirtajam saturam.\n"

#: src/plugins/dnf/subscription_manager.py:107
msgid "Not root, Subscription Management repositories not updated"
msgstr "Nav root, abonementu pārvaldības repozitoriji nav atjaunināti"

#: src/plugins/dnf/subscription_manager.py:136
#, python-format
msgid ""
"subscription-manager plugin disabled %d system repository with respect of "
"configuration in /etc/dnf/plugins/subscription-manager.conf"
msgid_plural ""
"subscription-manager plugin disabled %d system repositories with respect of "
"configuration in /etc/dnf/plugins/subscription-manager.conf"
msgstr[0] ""
"subscription-manager spraudnis atspējoja sistēmas repozitorijus (%d) saskaņā "
"ar konfigurāciju failā /etc/dnf/plugins/subscription-manager.conf"
msgstr[1] ""
"subscription-manager spraudnis atspējoja %d sistēmas repozitoriju saskaņā ar "
"konfigurāciju failā /etc/dnf/plugins/subscription-manager.conf"
msgstr[2] ""
"subscription-manager spraudnis atspējoja sistēmas repozitorijus (%d) saskaņā "
"ar konfigurāciju failā /etc/dnf/plugins/subscription-manager.conf"

#: src/plugins/dnf/subscription_manager.py:154
msgid "Updating Subscription Management repositories."
msgstr "Atjaunina abonementu pārvaldības repozitorijus."

#: src/plugins/dnf/subscription_manager.py:163
msgid "Unable to read consumer identity"
msgstr "Nevar nolasīt patērētāja identitāti"

#: src/plugins/dnf/subscription_manager.py:166
msgid "subscription-manager is operating in container mode."
msgstr "subscription-manager darbojas konteinera režīmā."

#: src/plugins/dnf/upload_profile.py:36
msgid ""
"Upload combined profile to Satellite server (list of installed RPMs, enabled "
"repositories and modules)"
msgstr ""
"Augšupielādēt apvienoto profilu Satellite serverī (instalēto RPM, iespējoto "
